    {
      "id": "github",
      "kind": "mcp",
      "name": "GitHub",
      "summary": "让 AI 直接看你 GitHub 上的仓库、问题和合并请求，也能按你的要求在上面提交改动。",
      "publisher": "GitHub 官方",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server",
      "providers": ["claude", "codex", "gemini", "grok"],
      "install": { "type": "http", "url": "https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/" },
      "inputs": [],
      "runtime": "none",
      "network": "always",
      "requiresAccount": true,
      "risks": ["remote-exec"],
      "riskNote": "要一个 GitHub 账号，装好之后还得在工具里登录一次授权。授权之后 AI 能改你这个账号有权限的仓库，所以别用公司的管理员账号来授权。",
      "pinnedVersion": null,
      "marketplaceCommit": null,
      "verifiedAt": "2026-09-21",
      "note": "这一条是 GitHub 自己在线提供的服务，不在你电脑上装东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-review",
      "kind": "plugin",
      "name": "代码审查",
      "summary": "让 Claude Code 在你提交之前把这次改动整体过一遍：分几个角度找可能的缺陷、被吞掉的报错、没跟上的测试，再按有多大把握排一遍序，把拿不准的筛掉。",
      "publisher": "Anthropic（Claude Code 官方插件市场）",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official/tree/main/plugins/code-review",
      "providers": ["claude"],
      "install": { "type": "plugin", "marketplace": "claude-plugins-official", "plugin": "code-review" },
      "inputs": [],
      "runtime": "prompt",
      "network": "install-only",
      "requiresAccount": false,
      "risks": ["extra-usage"],
      "riskNote": "它只看代码、只给意见，不动你的文件。代价是一次审查要跑好几轮，用掉的额度比平时问一句多不少。",
      "pinnedVersion": null,
      "marketplaceCommit": "c447c3207a425bc4e2a0d068435f64b0477ae981",
      "verifiedAt": "2026-09-21",
      "note": "装完在 Claude Code 里打一个斜杠，命令列表里就能看到 code-review。"
    },
    {
      "id": "commit-commands",
      "kind": "plugin",
      "name": "提交与合并请求",
      "summary": "把提交、推送、开合并请求这几步合成一条命令：让 Claude Code 自己看这次改了什么、写好提交说明、推上去，需要的话把合并请求也开出来。",
      "publisher": "Anthropic（Claude Code 官方插件市场）",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official/tree/main/plugins/commit-commands",
      "providers": ["claude"],
      "install": { "type": "plugin", "marketplace": "claude-plugins-official", "plugin": "commit-commands" },
      "inputs": [],
      "runtime": "prompt",
      "network": "install-only",
      "requiresAccount": false,
      "risks": ["git-write"],
      "riskNote": "它会在你当前这个仓库里执行提交和推送。推出去的改动要你自己到远端撤回，所以别在拿不准的分支上用。每条命令执行前 Claude Code 仍然会问你一次。",
      "pinnedVersion": null,
      "marketplaceCommit": "c447c3207a425bc4e2a0d068435f64b0477ae981",
      "verifiedAt": "2026-09-21",
      "note": "装完在斜杠命令列表里能看到 commit 和 commit-push-pr。"
    },
    {
      "id": "feature-dev",
      "kind": "plugin",
      "name": "功能开发流程",
      "summary": "做一个稍大的功能时，让 Claude Code 先摸清现有代码、再定实现方案、写完自己回头查一遍，而不是一上来就动手改。",
      "publisher": "Anthropic（Claude Code 官方插件市场）",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official/tree/main/plugins/feature-dev",
      "providers": ["claude"],
      "install": { "type": "plugin", "marketplace": "claude-plugins-official", "plugin": "feature-dev" },
      "inputs": [],
      "runtime": "prompt",
      "network": "install-only",
      "requiresAccount": false,
      "risks": ["extra-usage"],
      "riskNote": "动代码前会先花几轮读代码和定方案，所以更慢、也更费额度；换来的是不容易改到不该改的地方。它不会跳过 Claude Code 本来的那些确认。",
      "pinnedVersion": null,
      "marketplaceCommit": "c447c3207a425bc4e2a0d068435f64b0477ae981",
      "verifiedAt": "2026-09-21",
      "note": "装完在斜杠命令列表里能看到 feature-dev，后面跟上你想做的功能。"
    },
